OL,3,GNEWSAThe case against each man accused
OL,4,Aof abusing woman drugged by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis past week prosecutors have been
OL,7,Foutlining their case against a group of
OL,8,Fnine men - including a paramedic,
OL,9,Fchildren's football coach and taxi
OL,10,Fdriver - who allegedly raped or abused
OL,11,Fa woman after she had been drugged by
OL,12,Fher husband.
OL,14,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,15,Fprotect his wife's legal right to
OL,16,Fanonymity, had already pleaded guilty
OL,17,Fto 62 offences against her committed at
OL,18,Fthe home they shared in the Stockport
OL,19,Farea of Greater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
