OL,3,GNEWSAThe case against each man accused
OL,4,Aof abusing woman drugged by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour other men have also admitted
OL,7,Fsexual offences against her, but the
OL,8,Fremaining defendants deny all charges
OL,9,Fand are on trial at Manchester Minshull
OL,10,FStreet Crown Court.
OL,12,FLouise Oakley KC, lead counsel for the
OL,13,Fprosecution, has told the jury that
OL,14,Fboth the husband and the other men were
OL,15,Fleading "double lives" while secretly
OL,16,Ffulfilling their "barbaric fantasies".
